      "id": "d-rec-create",
      "name": "Create Generation Record (Atomic)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -1200,
        -680
      ],
      "notes": "One atomic call does both jobs: assigns the next sequential document number for the series AND creates the pending record keyed by idempotency_key, server-side, in a single compare-and-set operation. Two requests racing on the same idempotency_key can't both win -- the loser gets the winner's record back in the 409 body instead of its own number, which is what actually prevents a duplicate invoice number under concurrent retries."
    },
